--- | --- 
Configmaps | [false](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/pkg/registry/core/configmap/strategy.go#L75)
Leases | [true](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/pkg/registry/coordination/lease/strategy.go#L67)
